ly knows it.","category":"sign-in","subject":"identity","technique":"T1621","defaults":{"enabled":true,"severity":"high","threshold":5,"windowMs":900000},"tunable":{"threshold":[2,1000],"windowMs":[60000,86400000]},"enabled":true,"severity":"high","threshold":5,"windowMs":900000,"customized":false},{"id":"session-hijack","title":"Session used from another network","description":"A session bound to one network was presented from another (tenant policy bindSessionsToIp): a stolen cookie or token.","category":"sign-in","subject":"identity","technique":"T1550.004","defaults":{"enabled":true,"severity":"high"},"enabled":true,"severity":"high","customized":false},{"id":"new-network","title":"Sign-in from a new network","description":"A privileged person (owner, root administrator, or holder of an administrator role) signed in from a network not seen for them before.","category":"sign-in","subject":"identity","technique":"T1078","defaults":{"enabled":true,"severity":"medium"},"enabled":true,"severity":"medium","everyone":false,"customized":false},{"id":"dormant-reactivated","title":"Dormant account signed in","description":"Someone signed in to an account that had not been used for longer than the dormancy period.","category":"account","subject":"identity","technique":"T1078","defaults":{"enabled":true,"severity":"medium"},"enabled":true,"severity":"medium","customized":false},{"id":"account-takeover-persistence","title":"Account changes after a risky sign-in","description":"Shortly after a risky sign-in the account changed its sign-in methods (second factor removed, passkey or trusted device added, email or password changed, API key created).","category":"account","subject":"identity","technique":"T1098","defaults":{"enabled":true,"severity":"high","windowMs":3600000},"tunable":{"windowMs":[300000,604800000]},"enabled":true,"severity":"high","windowMs":3600000,"customized":false},{"id":"privilege-escalation","title":"Self-granted administrator role","description":"Someone